<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?>
<LanguageData>
  <!--EN: After laying an egg, it is common with those with the oviparous gene to go through a short period of sterility till they are capable of producing another. This is only a temporary condition and causes no long term effects.-->
  <VRESaurids_EggFatigue.description>卵生基因的携带者在产卵后，会暂时陷入无法生育的疲劳期，需要一定的时间来恢复。不会造成长期伤害。</VRESaurids_EggFatigue.description>
  <!--EN: egg fatigue-->
  <VRESaurids_EggFatigue.label>不育疲劳期</VRESaurids_EggFatigue.label>
  <!--EN: This pawn is cold blooded and their body will begin to shut down when too hot, it has the benefit of slowing their metabolism so they have a lower hunger rate however the longer this goes on the worse it will affect their capabilities up to the point where they die.-->
  <VRESaurids_HyperthermicSlowdown.description>这个角色拥有变温基因，温度过高时身体各项机能会开始逐渐下降，好处是可以减缓新陈代谢，不容易饥饿，但持续时间越长，对身体的影响也就越严重，甚至会死亡。</VRESaurids_HyperthermicSlowdown.description>
  <!--EN: hyperthermic slowdown-->
  <VRESaurids_HyperthermicSlowdown.label>高温怠惰</VRESaurids_HyperthermicSlowdown.label>
  <!--EN: This pawn is cold blooded and their body will begin to shut down when too cold, it has the benefit of slowing their metabolism so they have a lower hunger rate however the longer this goes on the worse it will affect their capabilities up to the point where they die.-->
  <VRESaurids_HypothermicSlowdown.description>这个角色拥有变温基因，温度过低时身体各项机能会开始逐渐下降，好处是可以减缓新陈代谢，不容易饥饿，但持续时间越长，对身体的影响也就越严重，甚至会死亡。</VRESaurids_HypothermicSlowdown.description>
  <!--EN: hypothermic slowdown-->
  <VRESaurids_HypothermicSlowdown.label>低温怠惰</VRESaurids_HypothermicSlowdown.label>
  <!--EN: claws-->
  <VRESaurids_SauridClaws.comps.0.tools.0.label>爪子</VRESaurids_SauridClaws.comps.0.tools.0.label>
</LanguageData>
